SUMMARY:Music Bingo at Highland Brewing
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Adventures 30’s & 40’s\nEver play music bingo? N
 o? Me either! Let's change that together!\n\nI have no idea what to expect
  from music bingo\, but the event is free\, and who doesn't love prizes an
 d food trucks (and beer\, if that's your vibe)?!\n\nThe link to the event 
 is below\, but here are the deets:\n\n"Get ready for a fun twist on bingo!
  Join us in the **Highland Taproom** every Tuesday from **6–8 PM** for *
 *Music Bingo with Spencer**. It’s **free to play**\, so bring your frien
 ds\, grab a drink\, and test your music knowledge while enjoying great vib
 es.\nEach round features your favorite tunes—match the songs to your bin
 go card and win awesome prizes! Plus\, enjoy delicious eats from **rotatin
 g food trucks** on-site."\n\nhttps://highlandbrewing.com/calendar/music-bi
 ngo/2026-09-15/\n\nMusic Bingo starts at 6p\, I will get there around 5:30
 p to snag a spot for the group! Feel free to show up any time before 6 (or
  send me a note if you will be late)!\n\nIf you are new to the meetup and 
 don't know me\, I'll be the one singing at the top of my lungs once the mu
 sic starts (and I'll have my pup with me)!\n\nCan't wait to see you all th
 ere :-)
